[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……私を助っ人に？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...You want my help?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい。この世界の錬金術について、\nあなた以上に詳しい人はなかなかいません",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. There's hardly anyone who knows more about this world's alchemy than you do."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あなたの知識と才能を私に貸してもらえませんか？\nヴァレリアを救うために",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Would you lend me your knowledge and talent? To help save Valeria?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "断る理由はないわね。\n私もヴァレリアの力になりたいもの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see no reason to refuse. I want to help Valeria as well."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとうございます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you so much!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ま、待って！\u3000……私も一緒に行くわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "W-wait! ...I'm coming too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アンチュもヴァレリアのために協力してくれるの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're going to help us save Valeria too, Antje?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その問いは、肯定も否定もできるかな。\n行動原理は、あくまでクリセルダだからね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That question can be answered both yes and no. After all, her motivation is purely Criselda."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ムラサキ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Violet"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アンチュちゃんはクリセルダに協力したいから行くんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje's going because she wants to help Criselda!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アオナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Azure"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そしてクリセルダが貴方たちに手を貸す以上……\n私も、貴方たちに全力で手を貸すわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And since Criselda is lending you her aid... I'll give it my all to help you too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふっ、嬉しいよ！\nアンチュちゃん、ありがとう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, that makes me happy! Thank you, Antje!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "べ、別に……お礼なんていらないわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-it's not like... I need your thanks or anything..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "クリセルダ次第とはいえ、レスナとは、\n味方のほうが、嬉しいしね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even if it's just because of Criselda... I'd rather be allies with Resna than enemies..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうそう、今回はユナも護衛として同行してもらうよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right, and Juna will be coming along as an escort this time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何があるか分からないし……\nクリセルダとアンチュの監視役も兼ねてね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We don't know what might happen... Plus she can keep an eye on Criselda and Antje."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ？\u3000監視だと？\u3000おめぇ王子でなければぶっ飛ばすぞ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? Keep an eye on us? If you weren't a prince, I'd sock you for that!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルアッカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Scarlet"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "王子でよかったよ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then thank goodness I'm a prince..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "監視なんて無用よ。\n天才のクリセルダがいれば何もかも上手くいくわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You don't need to watch us. With the brilliant Criselda here, everything will work out perfectly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあ？\u3000天才？\n何言ってるの、天才は、この私のみ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? Brilliant? What are you talking about? I'm the only genius here!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……どこが？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...In what way?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "は、はああ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "W-what did you say!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そこまで言うなら、\nどっちが天才か白黒つけようじゃないの！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If that's how you want to play it, let's settle once and for all who the real genius is!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ、私もついていくから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna, I'm coming along too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この二人、いつの間にか仲良しさんになったんだねぇ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "When did these two become such good friends?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]